Package: swaylock-plugin
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libpam-runtime
Recommends: swaybg
Description: Wayland screen locker with animated wallpaper plugins
 A swaylock fork that forwards layer-shell wallpaper applications to locked
 outputs, including GPU accelerated wallpapers such as Verdant. Requires a
 compositor implementing ext-session-lock-v1, such as Sway 1.9.
 Uses the host PAM login stack and installs alongside the distribution swaylock.
